<body></p>
<div class="rich_media">
<h1 class="rich_media_title" id="activity-name"><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3OTg3MjQyNg==&#038;mid=2247492065&#038;idx=3&#038;sn=9ee17e05f1f4b8e34fc63534bad14666&#038;chksm=cf7f7124f808f8321f60a41206653149f41d6c767bf65d8c42909a656c02a68aecaf561364cf#rd" target="_blank" rel="noopener">听说你还在困惑SCI配色问题？小图一文让你学会SCI顶刊的配色方案！！！</a></h1>
<div id="meta_content" class="rich_media_meta_list"><span class="rich_media_meta rich_media_meta_text">小图&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="rich_media_meta rich_media_meta_nickname" id="profileBt"><a href="javascript:void(0);" class="wx_tap_link js_wx_tap_highlight weui-wa-hotarea" id="js_name">生信果&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></span><em id="publish_time" class="rich_media_meta rich_media_meta_text">2023-09-07 19:00:30</em></div>
<p><content></p>
<div class="reprint">
<p>转自公众号：生信图<br /><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxODUxNDgzNA==&#038;mid=2247484842&#038;idx=1&#038;sn=31983adde6a9dbeca752145768349898" target="_blank" title="阅读原文" rel="noopener">http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxODUxNDgzNA==&#038;mid=2247484842&#038;idx=1&#038;sn=31983adde6a9dbeca752145768349898</a></p>
</div>
<section style="font-size: 16px;margin-bottom: 24px;">
<section style="display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: 50%;background-color: rgb(242, 183, 183);margin-right: 3px;flex: 0 0 auto;align-self: flex-end;height: auto;padding: 3px 10px;">
<section style="font-size: 17px;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: right;letter-spacing: 4px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p><strong>点击蓝字</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
<section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;border-left: 4px solid rgb(242, 183, 183);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;flex: 100 100 0%;align-self: stretch;height: auto;padding: 3px 10px;background-color: rgba(254, 245, 240, 0.8);">
<section style="color: rgb(181, 126, 121);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 4px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p><strong>关注小图</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.8;letter-spacing: 1px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p style="white-space: normal;">小伙伴在绘图的时候，经常会困惑，自己文章中的图片配色如何绘制才能显的高级。为什么顶级期刊配色都那么好看，小伙伴不要疑惑。这里小图给大家介绍一种SCI配色的R包ggsci，这个包很强大，提供了一系列的高质量的调色板，这个包的主要来源有SCI论文的期刊配色，还以一些可视化的数据库配色，还以我们经常看到的科幻电影中使用的配色，可谓是相当的多，跟着小图去学习吧！<br  /></p>
</section>
<p style="white-space: normal;" powered-by="xiumi.us"><br  /></p>
<section style="margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;border-left: 5px solid rgb(242, 203, 203);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding-left: 9px;min-width: 10%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-start;">
<section style="margin: 2px 0%;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="color: rgb(110, 75, 36);line-height: 1.3;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1px;">
<p style="white-space: normal;"><strong>我们先安装一下</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section class="code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js">
<ul class="code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js">
<li></li>
<li></li>
</ul>
<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"><span class="code-snippet__meta">#install.packages(<span class="code-snippet__meta-string">"ggsci"</span>)</span></span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">library(ggsci)</span></code></pre>
</section>
<section style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.8;letter-spacing: 1px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p style="white-space: normal;">ggsci中函数有很多，但是主要还是两种类型的函数：</p>
<p style="white-space: normal;">一种是直接在绘图中使用既有期刊风格的颜色方案。<strong>比如：</strong></p>
<p style="white-space: normal;">scale_color_palname()和scale_fill_palname()。而函数里的palnames指的是对应颜色风格的名字，例如：scale_color_npg()和scale_fill_npg()是nature风格的配色方案。</p>
<p style="white-space: normal;">另一种是函数是展示对应颜色风格的颜色的代码，例如pal_npg(&#8220;nrc&#8221;, alpha = 0.7)(9)，表示获取名为 &#8220;nrc&#8221; 的颜色调色板的第9个颜色值，并且这个颜色的透明度设置为 0.7。</p>
</section>
<section style="text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;"><img decoding="async" data-ratio="0.8079800498753117" data-s="300,640" src="https://i0.wp.com/www.biocloudservice.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/1_yZmsfJQ2oMw0JhLNx14ibCOicOvkRw.png?w=640" onerror="this.src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92enCFibrYwIDDSCkaRibSdjEDK72ByZmsfJQ2oMw0JhLNx14ibCOicOvkRw/640?wx_fmt=png'" data-type="png" data-w="802" style="vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;"  data-recalc-dims="1" /></section>
</section>
<section style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.8;letter-spacing: 1px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p style="white-space: normal;">上面是这个包主要的函数对应的风格颜色，我们就按照上述大致给小伙伴展示一下：</p>
</section>
<p style="white-space: normal;" powered-by="xiumi.us"><br  /></p>
<section style="display: flex;flex-flow: row;text-align: center;justify-content: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 20px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 0 0 0%;align-self: stretch;height: auto;background-position: 0% 0%;background-repeat: repeat-y;background-size: 100%;background-attachment: scroll;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92JNxSJhxCbgicpQpVrCobUHXibNPDfsn09zICec7OpDYU74YGoQWc7qOQ/640?wx_fmt=png&quot;);">
<section style="" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;width: 5px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;"></svg></section>
</section>
</section>
<section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 0 0 auto;align-self: stretch;min-width: 10%;height: auto;background-color: rgb(254, 227, 229);box-shadow: rgb(0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px;">
<section style="margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="color: rgb(84, 54, 54);padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 3px;">
<p style="text-align: center;white-space: normal;"><strong>下面介绍这两类函数的使用并且绘制配色</strong><strong>方案的颜色可视化</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section style="display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;flex: 0 0 0%;align-self: stretch;height: auto;background-position: 0% 0%;background-repeat: repeat-y;background-size: 100%;background-attachment: scroll;background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92hfyIPqeicq6C3fSCnHhn1Jj672JsvL2XYkOyb0jHyGooQqYtKcJVia4g/640?wx_fmt=png&quot;);">
<section style="" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;width: 5px;height: 10px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;"><svg viewbox="0 0 1 1" style="float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;"></svg></section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section style="margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;border-left: 5px solid rgb(242, 203, 203);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding-left: 9px;min-width: 10%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-start;">
<section style="margin: 2px 0%;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="color: rgb(110, 75, 36);line-height: 1.3;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1px;">
<p style="white-space: normal;"><strong>首先就是我们顶刊Nature配色风格</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section class="code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js">
<ul class="code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js">
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
</ul>
<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">library(scales) #我们这里使用scales用来展示颜色</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">## 自然出版集团 (Nature Publishing Group) 风格的颜色方案</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">mypal &lt;- pal_npg(<span class="code-snippet__string">"nrc"</span>, alpha = <span class="code-snippet__number">0.7</span>)(<span class="code-snippet__number">10</span>)</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"><span class="code-snippet__function">mypal</span></span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">show_col(mypal,ncol = <span class="code-snippet__number">5</span>)</span></code></pre>
</section>
<section style="text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;"><img decoding="async" data-ratio="0.41770186335403725" data-s="300,640" src="图片/生信果_2023-09-07_「转」听说你还在困惑SCI配色问题？小图一文让你学会SCI顶刊的配色方案！！！/2_vQz9wKBeYon0VgPqddBDpRxY9GctLg.png" onerror="this.src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92DuYvzxZ7q37m3JicNfe91AFEjvQz9wKBeYon0VgPqddBDpRxY9GctLg/640?wx_fmt=png'" data-type="png" data-w="644" style="vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;"  /></section>
</section>
<section style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.8;letter-spacing: 1px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p style="white-space: normal;">小伙伴注意，这里alpha参数是调整颜色的透明度，上面展示的alpha = 0.7的配色风格，这个值可以根据需要自己调整。</p>
<p style="white-space: normal;"><br  /></p>
</section>
<section style="margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;border-left: 5px solid rgb(242, 203, 203);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding-left: 9px;min-width: 10%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-start;">
<section style="margin: 2px 0%;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="color: rgb(110, 75, 36);line-height: 1.3;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1px;">
<p style="white-space: normal;"><strong>下面展示一下alpha = 1的NPG风格的颜色：</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section class="code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js">
<ul class="code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js">
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
</ul>
<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">## 自然出版集团 (Nature Publishing Group) 风格的颜色方案</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">mypal &lt;- pal_npg(<span class="code-snippet__string">"nrc"</span>, alpha = <span class="code-snippet__number">1</span>)(<span class="code-snippet__number">10</span>)</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"><span class="code-snippet__function">mypal</span></span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">show_col(mypal,ncol = <span class="code-snippet__number">5</span>)</span></code></pre>
</section>
<section style="text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;"><img decoding="async" data-ratio="0.41809672386895474" data-s="300,640" src="图片/生信果_2023-09-07_「转」听说你还在困惑SCI配色问题？小图一文让你学会SCI顶刊的配色方案！！！/3_Joic16RRibGALI0V5iauPniclicHXA.png" onerror="this.src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92zOg6mk0qbD2Ksr6Y9whdGKbPBhgV4Joic16RRibGALI0V5iauPniclicHXA/640?wx_fmt=png'" data-type="png" data-w="641" style="vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;"  /></section>
</section>
<p style="white-space: normal;" powered-by="xiumi.us"><br  /></p>
<section style="margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;border-left: 5px solid rgb(242, 203, 203);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding-left: 9px;min-width: 10%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: flex-start;">
<section style="margin: 2px 0%;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="color: rgb(110, 75, 36);line-height: 1.3;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1px;">
<p style="white-space: normal;"><strong>再来看一下</strong></p>
</section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section class="code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js">
<ul class="code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js">
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
</ul>
<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">## 美国科学促进会 (American Association <span class="code-snippet__keyword">for</span> the Advancement of Science) 风格的颜色方案。</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">mypal &lt;- pal_aaas(palette = c(<span class="code-snippet__string">"default"</span>), alpha = <span class="code-snippet__number">0.7</span>)(<span class="code-snippet__number">10</span>)</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"><span class="code-snippet__function">mypal</span></span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"><span class="code-snippet__title">show_col</span><span class="code-snippet__params">(mypal,ncol = <span class="code-snippet__number">5</span>)</span></span></code></pre>
