<li></li>
</ul>
<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p1 &lt;- ggplot(subset(diamonds, carat &gt;= <span class="code-snippet__number">2.2</span>), aes(x = table, y = price, colour = cut)) +</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"> &nbsp;geom_point(alpha = <span class="code-snippet__number">0.7</span>) +</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"> &nbsp;geom_smooth(method = <span class="code-snippet__string">"loess"</span>, alpha = <span class="code-snippet__number">0.05</span>, linewidth = <span class="code-snippet__number">1</span>, span = <span class="code-snippet__number">1</span>) +</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"> &nbsp;theme_bw()</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p1</span></code></pre>
</section>
<section style="text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;"><img decoding="async" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9787556904400607" data-s="300,640" src="https://i0.wp.com/www.biocloudservice.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/13_brRWhTZrItrpzjUus0nJ9FxCULSCuQ.png?w=640" onerror="this.src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92jMyvibW7kPeRW4EV9s05aeQSiaibrRWhTZrItrpzjUus0nJ9FxCULSCuQ/640?wx_fmt=png'" data-type="png" data-w="659" style="vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;"  data-recalc-dims="1" /></section>
</section>
<p style="white-space: normal;" powered-by="xiumi.us"><br  /></p>
<section class="code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js">
<ul class="code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js">
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
<li></li>
</ul>
<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p2 &lt;- ggplot(subset(diamonds, carat &gt; <span class="code-snippet__number">2.2</span> &amp; depth &gt; <span class="code-snippet__number">55</span> &amp; depth &lt; <span class="code-snippet__number">70</span>), aes(x = depth, fill = cut)) +</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"> &nbsp;geom_histogram(colour = <span class="code-snippet__string">"black"</span>, binwidth = <span class="code-snippet__number">1</span>, position = <span class="code-snippet__string">"dodge"</span>) +</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer"> &nbsp;theme_bw()</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p2</span></code></pre>
</section>
<section style="text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<section style="vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;"><img decoding="async" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.007716049382716" data-s="300,640" src="图片/生信果_2023-09-07_「转」听说你还在困惑SCI配色问题？小图一文让你学会SCI顶刊的配色方案！！！/14_VibsvHhF1S2VfmUSLrT3tViajn2FAg.png" onerror="this.src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2wJ7bWfS0QuT9KJmzophrib2ecM5JQN92s7Ufee4JeJ5zM3Bd7gX4XKQCESVibsvHhF1S2VfmUSLrT3tViajn2FAg/640?wx_fmt=png'" data-type="png" data-w="648" style="vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;"  /></section>
</section>
<section style="font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.8;letter-spacing: 1px;" powered-by="xiumi.us">
<p style="white-space: normal;">小图觉得还是很好看的</p>
