<pre class="code-snippet__js" data-lang="c"><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p1_npg &lt;- p1 + scale_color_npg()</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p2_npg &lt;- p2 + scale_fill_npg()</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p1_npg</span></code><code><span class="code-snippet_outer">p2_npg</span></code></pre>
